  just starting to explore options outside or alongside the tenure track\,
  this upcoming event is designed specifically for graduate and PhD studen
 ts ready to translate their advanced training into high-impact careers.</
 p><p><strong>Why You Should Attend</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Hear from 
