DESCRIPTION:High-stakes foreign policy and national security work require
  more than classroom theory\, they require federal clearance.For students
  pursuing diplomacy\, intelligence\, cyber policy\, or defense consulting
 \, understanding how federal agencies evaluate suitability is essential.J
 oin the HLS Office of Policy Engagement and Strategic Partnerships for an
  exclusive\, off-the-record session with a federal Special Agent. Get dir
