 aluate foreign connections\, and clear candidates for national security r
 oles.What We Are Covering in 60 Minutes:SF-86 &amp\; Global Footprints: H
 ow background investigators review study abroad trips\, foreign travel\, 
 non-U.S. citizen contacts\, and dual ties.Federal Standards vs. Real Life
 : The hard lines on financial disclosures\, social media activity\, and f
 ederal drug laws vs. state legalizations.    The Investigation Lifecycle:
  What actually happens during polygraphs\, field investigations\, and sui
 tability reviews.    Strategic Federal Timing: How to position yourself f
 or agency sponsorship early through federal programs and internships befo
 re graduation.
