 or of law and global politics at Hosei University in Japan.
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>The Association of Central Eurasian Students (ACES
 ) warmly invites you to an upcoming Horizon Talk titled "<em>The Soviet F
 actor in China's Regional Ethnic Autonomy: A Sino-Soviet Comparison of In
 stitutions and Ethnic Elites</em>"\, featuring Dr. Jun Kumakura from Hose
 i University\, Japan.</p>
