LOCATION:IMU
SUMMARY:The one thing you need to know about climate change
DESCRIPTION:Come join moderator Nikos Zirogiannis (O'Neill School) and fi
 ve other IUB faculty members as they share the one thing you need to know
  about climate change.  Christopher Callahan (O'Neill School)\, Rebecca D
 irksen (Ethnomusicology)\, Sara Gregg (History)\, Kim Novick (O'Neill and
  ESSI)\, and Spencer Perry (Education) will each share five minutes of wh
 at they want us to know about climate change.  These talks will be follow
 ed by discussion and Q&amp\;A. All IU and Bloomington community members a
 re invited to attend and learn with us during this Climate Week event.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Come join moderator Nikos Zirogiannis (
 O'Neill School) and five other IUB faculty members as they share the one 
 thing you need to know about climate change.</p><p>  Christopher Callahan
  (O'Neill School)\, Rebecca Dirksen (Ethnomusicology)\, Sara Gregg (Histo
 ry)\, Kim Novick (O'Neill and ESSI)\, and Spencer Perry (Education) will 
 each share five minutes of what they want us to know about climate change
 .</p><p>  These talks will be followed by discussion and Q&amp\;A. All IU
  and Bloomington community members are invited to attend and learn with u
 s during this Climate Week event.</p>
