 ility and resilience champions from government\, higher education\, nonpr
 oﬁt\, and corporate organizations.Where: Embassy Suites Event Center in
  Plainfield\, Ind.When: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Friday\, Feb. 5\, 2027
